OL,3,GNEWSAEight more arrests after Celtic
OL,4,Atitle party disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating disorder in
OL,7,FGlasgow city centre after Celtic won
OL,8,Fthe Premiership title in May have made
OL,9,Fa further eight arrests bringing the
OL,10,Ftotal to 32.
OL,12,FFour men - aged 55, 52, 22 and 19 -
OL,13,Fhave been charged in connection with
OL,14,Foffences including assault and culpable
OL,15,Fand reckless conduct.
OL,17,FThree male youths and one female youth
OL,18,Fhave also been charged in connection
OL,19,Fwith culpable and reckless conduct.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
