OL,3,GNEWSAEight more arrests after Celtic
OL,4,Atitle party disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo officers were seriously injured and
OL,7,Fthree members of the public required
OL,8,Fhospital treatment after the trouble in
OL,9,Fthe Trongate area of the city on
OL,10,FSaturday 16 May.
